    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap Multi-Channel Q15 Fixed-Point Audio Mixer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a zero-malloc multi-channel software PCM audio mixer. Blends multiple active 16-bit PCM audio channels into a single output buffer with per-channel gain, master gain, looping support, and Q15 saturation protection against clipping. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
